ntb-dps:  ntb-dps 1.2
ntb-dps:
ntb-dps:  These are the binaries for the dvips driver, a program that translates
ntb-dps:  .dvi files into postscript files. This package also contains some 
ntb-dps:  metric files for postscript fonts. You can configure divps with the 
ntb-dps:  file /usr/lib/texmf/dvips/config.ps for your own printer. Dvips can 
ntb-dps:  also help you to print files on a printer for which no dvi driver is
ntb-dps:  provided. Translate the dvi file to a postscript file and print it
ntb-dps:  with ghostscript. (Ghostscript is not included in the T series.) The
ntb-dps:  current version of dvipsk (the 'k' indicates that the sources use the
ntb-dps:  kpathsea library) is 5.58a.
